      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "A professional roof inspection in Utah typically costs between $130 and $350, with a statewide average hovering around $190.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "between $130 and $350"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1,
          2
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "However, many local contractors offer basic visual inspections for free if you are using them to get a repair or replacement quote.",
        "reference_indexes": [
          3,
          4
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Cost Breakdown by Inspection Type"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "The ultimate cost of the inspection depends heavily on the method the inspector must use to evaluate your roof safely and thoroughly:"
